  type_object_err_self_routine.pcpp - break step of type_object.pcpp:
  self in a routine: self is a method's object (SM0011)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_object_err_self_routine.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_object_err_self_routine.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
